  - mekong-delta
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of a chance-constrained safety gate that uses a
  FAO-56 water-balance digital twin to simulate irrigation commands before
  transmission over lossy networks, with a proven fidelity threshold
  sigma* = W/(2 z_{1-delta/2}) below which silence (WITHHELD) is optimal.
  Includes the full 36,480-episode simulation suite on real ERA5 forcing,
  seven invariant tests, and one-command reproduction of every published number.
